        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="1N74XsZe5HaOwDHVRuP_-11" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=light-dark(#008A00,#00994D);fontColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#005700;align=left;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;These rules are grounded in failure cases identified from real FSR documents.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;resolved&lt;/b&gt;: We have enough clear evidence from rules and document text to assign ESN/equipment confidently.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;ambiguous&lt;/b&gt;: Evidence is mixed or incomplete, so deterministic rules are not enough; send this region to the LLM path.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;unresolved&lt;/b&gt;: Document text alone is not enough (even with LLM); requires external lookup (IBAT).&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
