  <diagram id="CcV267pVGRbnRJF6B-v3" name="Page-2">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1232" dy="697" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="2bIBlo5SkiZwGY85J4Vb-1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fontSize=6;labelBackgroundColor=default;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Classification Rules (Quick Summary)&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Use these rules in order for each bug.&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Classify as Deterministic processor fix when the issue is about structure, extraction, or state logic.&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Section/header/boundary detection problems&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;ESN regex/format parsing and normalization&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Active vs inactive ESN filtering&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Context stack enter/exit and fallback path bugs&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Deterministic unresolved tagging for low-information docs&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Classify as LLM preprocessor when attribution is ambiguous and needs semantic inference.&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Generator evidence exists but ESN is missing or implicit&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Multiple plausible ESNs and deterministic signals are insufficient&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Shared/summary/auxiliary sections that need multi-assign reasoning&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Cross-context conflicts where text meaning outweighs local pattern hits&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Classify as unresolved (LLM plus IBAT path) when text alone cannot identify the ESN.&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;No usable ESN in body text and no deterministic tie-breaker&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;LLM may suggest attribution, but final resolution needs external hierarchy/train lookup&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;For mixed bugs, split handling by stage.&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Deterministic stage must detect ambiguity and avoid forced wrong assignment&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;LLM stage resolves only ambiguous canonical regions&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;IBAT stage resolves truly unresolved cases&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Guardrail: parser quality defects are deterministic prerequisites.&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;If region boundaries are wrong, do not treat this as an LLM-first fix.&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Fix extraction/segmentation first, then run ambiguity routing.&lt;/h1&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="800" width="680" x="20" y="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
